					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>A prisoner being held by &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Psyck Chokers&lt;/color&gt; has managed to steal a radio and call you!

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Jimmy&lt;/color&gt; is being held at a camp near &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Stonkley&lt;/color&gt; under armed guard. Rescue him, and he will join your colony. He is a 31-year-old corporate drone. He says that &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 turrets and 1 waster&lt;/color&gt; defend the site and there may be an &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;unknown threat&lt;/color&gt;.

Jimmy has these relationships with your colonists:

  - Father of man in black Trev
  - Fiance of colonist Lacey

If you miss this opportunity, you may never hear from &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Jimmy&lt;/color&gt; again.</description>
