			<li Class="AutoRimmer.AlertMuteComponent">
				<autoRimmerAlertMutes>
					<keys>
						<li>Alert_NeedWarmClothes</li>
						<li>Alert_RolesEmpty</li>
					</keys>
					<values>
						<li>Spring day 7, avg tile temp 10.1C; the fix is a supply chain not an act — cotton zone 2 (90 cells) sown today feeds the HandTailoringBench in ly-5 workshop, and ComplexClothing is already researched. The alert forecasts 3 twelfths ahead and counts stockpiled apparel only, so it will flicker on every cold snap until that line produces. RELEASE when a parka or duster exists in things, or by day 14 at the latest whichever is sooner.</li>
						<li>Ideology role assignment is an explicit non-goal of 664e9b9 (Royalty/Ideology/Biotech/Anomaly observed only). Painism also costs Wouter -6 No-Blindfolder / -5 Not-blind on mood and neither is addressable in scope. Standing decision not to act, recorded so day 20 can read what day 12 decided.</li>
					</values>
				</autoRimmerAlertMutes>
			</li>
