						<name>Free Path</name>
						<adjective>ideological</adjective>
						<memberName>Ideologist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Awoken Mind</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Awoken Mind</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Oppressed by distant rulers who demanded uniform obedience from the people, Star 'Akari' Fallon created a rebel movement that smashed the state and built a new land of liberty in its place. Akari broke every social rule the oppressors tried to enforce, just to show that she could. Akari's speech at a &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Mourning of Ideology&lt;/color&gt; inspired many to lead a liberal life.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Oppressed by distant rulers who demanded uniform obedience from the people, Star 'Akari' Fallon created a rebel movement that smashed the state and built a new land of liberty in its place. Akari broke every social rule the oppressors tried to enforce, just to show that she could. Akari's speech at a %%ritual0_name%% inspired many to lead a liberal life.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
