						<memberName>Archotechnist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Shining Archist</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Shining Archist</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Archotechs are the next natural step in the development of consciousness. Archotechs are evil and the most important task for humanity is to understand them so we can escape their influence. In the end, archotechs will teach us to move effortlessly amongst the stars if we observe their cosmic wisdom.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Archotechs are the next natural step in the development of consciousness. Archotechs are evil and the most important task for humanity is to understand them so we can escape their influence. In the end, archotechs will teach us to move effortlessly amongst the stars if we observe their cosmic wisdom.</descriptionTemplate>
